    "updated_at": "2022-11-28T01:48:53Z",
    "body": "The serialization for `border-radius` was completely broken in WebKit, unrelated to `-webkit-border-radius`.\r\nI just fixed it, now it produces `1px / 2px`.\r\nGecko says `1px 2px` since it treats `-webkit-border-alias` as a pure alias.",
